        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-CLW6002ACHSBR, Round Clearwater Glass Shower Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2 Inch Diameter Clearwater Shower Knob Set comes packaged with all the hardware you'll need to install it on a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass door. It is packaged as a set with two knobs. The knob is made out of hand chiseled acrylic. The Round Clearwater Shower Knob Pair has a 2 inch overall diameter. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CLW06-specifications.gif?v=1704354519\" width=\"463\" height=\"226\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions SD-CLW6002ACHSBR Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available as a <a href=\"/products/2-inch-square-clearwater-shower-knob-set-first-impressions-sd-clw7002achsbr\"><b>2\" Square Clearwater Shower Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions SD-CLW6002ACHSBR Clearwater Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Hand Chiseled Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mount Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Thickness: .67\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.92\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</i>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CLW06-specifications.pdf?v=1704262333\"><b>First Impressions SD-CLW6002ACHSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 door pulls and mounting hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
