                "title": "2 Inch Diameter Clearwater Shower Knob Set",
                "description": "The 2 Inch Diameter Clearwater Shower Knob Set comes packaged with all the hardware you'll need to install it on a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass door. It is packaged as a set with two knobs. The knob is made out of hand chiseled acrylic. It has a 2 inch overall diameter. \r\n",
